# Android Release Keystore Configuration
# 
# Copy this file to 'android/keystore.properties' and fill in your keystore details.
# This file is gitignored and should NOT be committed to version control.
#
# To get your keystore from EAS:
# 1. Contact EAS support to download your keystore, OR
# 2. If you have access to the keystore, place it in the android/app directory
#
# Example configuration:
# Note: storeFile path is relative to android/app/ directory (where build.gradle is)
storeFile=your-release-key.keystore
storePassword=your-store-password
keyAlias=your-key-alias
keyPassword=your-key-password

# Notes:
# - storeFile: Path to your .keystore or .jks file (relative to android/app/ directory where build.gradle is)
# - storePassword: Password for the keystore file
# - keyAlias: Alias name of the key in the keystore
# - keyPassword: Password for the specific key (may be same as storePassword)

